<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Packers And Movers In Business
    </h2>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I grow the business of packers and movers in a competitive market?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Growth hinges on building trust, leveraging digital marketing, and expanding service portfolios. Showcase verified customer reviews, obtain IBA and ISO certifications, and highlight 100% insurance coverage. Invest in SEO‑optimized local listings, run targeted ads for &quot;Packers And Movers In Business,&quot; and partner with corporate clients for recurring contracts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the most effective ways to promote a packers and movers business locally?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Combine online and offline tactics: claim and optimize Google My Business, run geo‑targeted PPC campaigns using the primary keyword, and distribute flyers in business districts. Host webinars on relocation best practices, sponsor local trade events, and encourage satisfied clients to share referrals on social platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are mandatory for a business relocation via national highways?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Key paperwork includes a GST‑compliant invoice, e‑Way Bill generated for the cargo, IBA mover code certificate, vehicle registration, and a signed insurance policy. Additionally, obtain any sector‑specific clearances (e.g., IT hardware) and retain copies of loading and unloading checklists for audit purposes.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the service tax rate applied to packers and movers services in India?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Service tax on relocation services follows the GST regime. As of the current fiscal year, a 5% GST is levied on the total invoice value, with an additional 0.5% cess for certain categories. Ensure the invoice clearly separates moving charges, packaging, and insurance to calculate tax accurately.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken when moving heavy office furniture and equipment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Professional movers use hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings on multi‑axle trucks. Items are secured with anti‑slip mats and padded straps. The 7‑layer packaging system protects delicate components, while real‑time GPS monitoring ensures route compliance and rapid response to any incident.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer protective packaging safeguard delicate office assets?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each layer addresses a specific risk: high‑density bubble cushioning absorbs shocks, multi‑ply corrugated sheets provide structural rigidity, foam edge protectors guard corners, stretch film offers weather resistance, and custom wooden crates secure fragile equipment. Together they meet IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance standards, minimizing damage claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I expect from the insurance coverage during a business shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 100% insured policy covers full declared value of all goods, including office furniture, electronics, and documents. In case of loss or damage, the insurer processes claims within 7‑10 business days, provided the mover submits the incident report, photos, and original packing documentation as per IRDAI guidelines.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
